id: DRAFT-libnxt-0.5.2-meson-thin-archive-install-true-ar-repack
trigger_tool: meson|conan|test
phase: linking
error_signature: could not get the buffer for a child of the archive|Unknown option: b_thin_archives
severity: 3
category: build-system, testing, ohos
match_keywords: compile_error, hmbs_repair_method, thin_archive, meson_install_true
title: Meson未安装静态库默认thin归档致消费者链接断裂的install:true根治与ar重打兜底
root_cause: Meson大于等于0.60对未安装静态库默认产出thin归档成员为相对引用配方仅拷贝单文件进包致消费者ld.lld引用悬空属构建系统通用行为缺陷非单库源码问题
affected_scope: 上游meson.build中static_library缺install:true且配方仅拷贝单点a的Meson类静态库消费者在OHOS真机链接期复现
affected_scope: 上游meson.build中static_library缺install:true且配方仅拷贝单文件进包的Meson类静态库消费者在OHOS真机链接期复现
verification_cmd: 真机conan create全链路验证由62231的ld.lld断裂推进到62646编译通过test_package进入后续ctest阶段确认完整归档产出
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: install-true-plus-ar-repack
rec_description: 补丁给static_library加install:true使Meson直接产出完整归档package以8字节魔数判定thin命中则收集同级目标对象目录用已探测archiver执行ar重打完整包后拷贝到lib
rec_command: patches/0001-use-prebuilt-flash-driver.patch追加install:true第二hunk；conanfile.py删除b_thin_archives下发保留魔数判定加ar重打兜底；manifest.yaml同步知识条目
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: ar-repack-only-fallback
fallback_description: 若上游拒绝install:true语义变更则保留package侧魔数判定加ar重打兜底单独保证交付完整归档不阻断主链路
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: b_thin_archives
forbid_1_reason: Meson无b_thin_archives内建选项经tc.project_options下发必报Unknown option中断meson.configure
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检meson.configure失败任务退回补丁修正循环无法进入编译
